There's no tsconfig or linter in the repo, so `bun test` is the project's own check. Two things I decided beyond the literal spec: `RangeError` is thrown when the debounced function is created (rather than per call), and `ms = 0` is allowed since only "below 0" is specified to throw.

One note: an earlier run showed 2 failures that were purely a bug in my own test helper (I destructured a live getter `pendingCount` into a stale value); the implementation was fine, and I fixed the helper.

